  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Civil Society Support Program (CSSP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">First phase of CSSP (ETH-09/028) was implemented until September 2017. Second phase of CSSP (CSSP II) will be implemented for three years (2018 to 2021). Arrangement for delegated cooperation was signed by contributing donors: Norway, Sweden, DFID and Irish Aid. DFID will be the lead development partner. The purpose of the program is to support CSOs to achieve more effective engagement by CSOs with government on issues that matter to poor people.</narrative>
  </description>
